{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51489","headline":"骊山怀古（五首） 一 · 李郢","name":"骊山怀古（五首） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武帝寻仙驾海游，禁门高闭水空流。\n深宫带日年年静，翠柏凝烟夜夜愁。\n鸾凤影沉归万古，歌钟声断梦千秋。\n晚来惆怅无人会，云水犹飞傍玉楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}